              "t": "xref",
              "page": "python/python_computer_vision",
              "section": "7-computer-vision",
              "v": "7. Computer Vision"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " project, with the addition of face detection algorithms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "When you appear in front of the camera, it will recognize your face and adjust its gimbal to keep your face in the center of the frame."
            }
          ]
